n style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">NOTE: Incomplete applications received may not be considered. Resumes are welcomed but do not take the place of the completed State Application STD 678. Applications received via fax or email will NOT be accepted. If you would like confirmation of receipt, please send certified mail.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br />**A candidate pool may be established for subsequent vacancies.**</span></strong></div><div style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">**All hires may be subject to a criminal background check.**</span></strong></div><div style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">**We encourage applicants to apply electronically.**</span></strong></div></span>
